1
00:00:00,874 --> 00:00:03,174
(Amy:)before he shut down.

2
00:00:03,177 --> 00:00:05,507
(Amy:)Whenever I see
a bucket of dirty water,

3
00:00:05,512 --> 00:00:09,282
I still hear "Lady in Red."

4
00:00:11,118 --> 00:00:13,348
(Bernadette:)My prom was pretty
terrible, too.

5
00:00:13,353 --> 00:00:14,523
(Bernadette:)I was so excited
about my date,

6
00:00:14,521 --> 00:00:16,351
(Bernadette:)but it turned out
he only asked me

7
00:00:16,356 --> 00:00:17,326
(Bernadette:)'cause he liked my friend.

8
00:00:17,324 --> 00:00:19,454
(Bernadette:)He spent the whole night
talking about her.

9
00:00:19,459 --> 00:00:21,859
(Amy:)Okay, we get it, you had
a friend and a date.

10
00:00:21,862 --> 00:00:23,532
(Amy:)Stop bragging.

11
00:00:23,530 --> 00:00:25,330
(Penny:)Doesn't matter.

12
00:00:25,332 --> 00:00:26,682
(Penny:)Prom is silly anyways.

13
00:00:26,683 --> 00:00:28,033
(Bernadette:)Easy for you to say;
you probably went

14
00:00:28,035 --> 00:00:29,335
(Bernadette:)with the captain
of the football team.

15
00:00:29,336 --> 00:00:31,506
(scoffs)
No.

16
00:00:31,505 --> 00:00:33,305
(Penny:)I just made out
with him a little

17
00:00:33,307 --> 00:00:35,177
(Penny:)while his date was puking.

18
00:00:35,175 --> 00:00:38,375
(Amy:)My date would've had
to clean that up.

19
00:00:39,746 --> 00:00:41,376
(Bernadette:)Ooh, I have an idea.

20
00:00:41,381 --> 00:00:44,351
(Bernadette:)Maybe we can have,
like, a prom do-over.

21
00:00:44,351 --> 00:00:46,321
(Amy:)Oh, that would be so much fun.

22
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:49,150
(Amy:)We could decorate the roof
and make the guys wear tuxedos.

23
00:00:49,156 --> 00:00:50,926
(Bernadette:)Ooh, and get our hair done,
and slow-dance.

24
00:00:50,924 --> 00:00:52,354
(Penny:)Okay, guys, trust me,

25
00:00:52,359 --> 00:00:54,159
(Penny:)as someone who's been to,
like, seven proms,

26
00:00:54,161 --> 00:00:56,361
(Penny:)it is never as good
as you want it to be.

27
00:00:56,363 --> 00:00:59,193
(Amy:)You went to seven proms?

28
00:00:59,199 --> 00:01:00,369
(Penny:)Yeah, let's see.

